                </div>
                <p id="studio-pacman-description" class="pacman-popup-note">Press play in Demo 01. Pac-Man eats clips in chronological order. If the next clip starts on another track first, Pac-Man changes lane and leaves the current clip shortened. The counter includes only clips eaten to their end; the run is lost when at least half of the clips are almost eaten. At the end of the demo, Pac-Man smiles if the run is not lost and frowns after a loss.</p>
